2026-02-10 22:16:44,036 - DocumentGraderNode - INFO: Retrieved document Negative Return on Equity

A negative ROE due to the company having a net loss or negative shareholders’ equity cannot be used to analyze the company, nor can it be used to compare against companies with a positive ROE. The term ROE is a misnomer in this situation as there is no return; the more appropriate classification is to consider what the loss on equity is. is relevant
